🔧 ADK Example

Suppose you want to create a Business Consultant Agent.

User says:

"My textile shop sales decreased by 20%. Analyze the problem and suggest what I should do."

Your ADK agent could have tools like:

Business Consultant Agent
        │
        ├── Sales Analysis Tool
        │
        ├── Market Research Tool
        │
        ├── Profit Calculator
        │
        └── Report Generator

The agent decides which tool to use.

For example:

User
 ↓
"Sales decreased by 20%"
 ↓
Business Consultant Agent
 ↓
Sales Analysis Tool
 ↓
Market Research Tool
 ↓
Profit Calculator
 ↓
AI analyzes results
 ↓
Business Recommendation

